{"id":"dc4698715ffc941e","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-tree11-derived-tree-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Derived Tree Sequence","display":"df-zfc-tree11-derived-tree-sequence — ZFC Tree11 Derived Tree Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-derived-tree-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-derived-tree-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-derived-tree-sequence — ZFC Tree11 Derived Tree Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree10-derivative-of-tree]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-derived-tree-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-derived-tree-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-derived-tree-sequence — ZFC Tree11 Derived Tree Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b8da74056d30711b\" href=\"?note=b8da74056d30711b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree10-derivative-of-tree\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree10-derivative-of-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (initial tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (sequence candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10DerivativeOfTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10DerivativeOfTree}_S\\)</span> (tree-derivative predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b8da74056d30711b\" href=\"?note=b8da74056d30711b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree10-derivative-of-tree\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-tree10-derivative-of-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11DerivedTreeSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11DerivedTreeSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}derived\\text{-}tree\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11DerivedTreeSequence}_S(D,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\theta\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(D,\\theta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(D))\n\\land\nD(0)=T\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10DerivativeOfTree}_S\n(D(\\alpha+1),D(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta+1\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\to\nD(\\lambda)=\\bigcap_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}D(\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}derived\\text{-}tree\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11DerivedTreeSequence}_S(D,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\theta\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(D,\\theta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(D))\n\\land\nD(0)=T\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10DerivativeOfTree}_S\n(D(\\alpha+1),D(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta+1\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\to\nD(\\lambda)=\\bigcap_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}D(\\beta)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Successor stages use the derivative predicate and nonzero limit stages use intersections; the previous formula omitted every limit-stage clause and did not type the sequence domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}